    "asOf": "2026-10-19",
    "notes": "The school list is the DepEd National Inventory Dashboard for the Marikina City division (33 schools; 33 of 33 had submitted to the inventory). School names are as printed there. Level is read from the name suffix (ES = elementary; HS/NHS or 'High School' = secondary; Integrated School). The dashboard does not give the barangay, so barangay is null. Private schools, other higher-education institutions (CHED HEI list: ched.gov.ph unreachable on 2026-10-19), health facilities (DOH NHFR unreachable) and city markets, libraries and sports facilities are not in this file. Pamantasan ng Lungsod ng Marikina is the only college listed, taken from the city's own charter; Marikina Polytechnic College and others are not verified."
  },
